This is a custom interactive visualization of the application's execution and verification process.

The Trust Engine must visually represent:

REQUEST
→ PLAN
→ APPROVAL
→ EXECUTION
→ VERIFICATION
→ RESULT

Represent these stages as a connected, animated system rather than a generic progress bar.

Use a combination of:
